    {
      "heading": "What these questions ask",
      "lines": [
        {
          "say": "Comparing questions give you two or more amounts and ask which is bigger.",
          "write": "Which is bigger?"
        },
        {
          "say": "They can be fractions, percentages, measurements, prices or expressions.",
          "write": "fractions · % · units · prices"
        },
        {
          "say": "Often you do not need the exact answer. Just which way it goes."
        },
        {
          "say": "Some ask for the largest. Some give you Quantity A and Quantity B.",
